<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Leap Day: a frog on a lily pad crouches and leaps right over the G, lands with a splash on the far pad, blinks, then
    hops home along the bottom by way of a little middle pad. A calendar page shows the 29th. One 3.6s loop.

    See doodle_halloween.xml for the layout: a 48x48 viewport around the widget's own G (12..36), which isn't drawn here.
-->
